  "contentHtml": "<p>Microsoft has released a security update stating that multiple vulnerabilities have been discovered in the following products:</p>\n<p>a) Microsoft Windows 7, 8.1, RT 8.1, and 10</p>\n<p>b) Microsoft Windows Server 2008, 2008 R2, 2012, 2012 R2, 2016</p>\n<p>c) Microsoft Windows Server Core Installation 2008, 2008 R2, 2012, 2012 R2, 2016</p>\n<p>d) Microsoft Office 2010, 2013, 2013 RT, 2016, 2016 Click-to-Run</p>\n<p>e) Microsoft Access 2013, 2016</p>\n<p>f) Microsoft Internet Explorer 9, 10, 11</p>\n<p>g) Microsoft Edge</p>\n<p>h) Microsoft SharePoint Enterprise Server 2013, 2016</p>\n<p>i) Microsoft Visual Studio 2010, 2012, 2013, 2015, 2017</p>\n<p>j) Powershell</p>\n<p>k) Microsoft .NET Framework</p>\n<p>l) ChakraCore</p>\n<p>m) Skype for Business 2016</p>\n<p>n) Expression Blend 4</p>\n<p>o) ASP.NET Core</p>\n<p>p) ASP.NET Web Pages</p>\n<p>q) ASP.NET MVC</p>\n<table>\n<tr>\n<td>A list of these vulnerabilities and how they affect the Microsoft Products can be found on the Microsoft Website at <a href=\"https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-us/security-guidance/summary\"><font size=\"2\" color=\"maroon\">https://portal.msrc.microsoft.com/en-us/security-guidance/summary</font></a></td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n",
